{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redcodeworks/octarine-bins/pulls/19","id":5349808219,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVwwEoc8AAAABPt-YWw","html_url":"https://github.com/redcodeworks/octarine-bins/pull/19","diff_url":"https://github.com/redcodeworks/octarine-bins/pull/19.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/redcodeworks/octarine-bins/pull/19.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redcodeworks/octarine-bins/issues/19","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redcodeworks/octarine-bins/pulls/19/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redcodeworks/octarine-bins/pulls/19/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redcodeworks/octarine-bins/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redcodeworks/octarine-bins/issues/19/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/redcodeworks/octarine-bins/statuses/2b05440492ab3064bef5ec1419d5839200fcf197","number":19,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix installer: dnf5 swallowed the list after an a|b line (dx installed 101 of 112); read lists first, check counts","user":{"login":"redcodeworks","id":53149657,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTQ5NjU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53149657?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/redcodeworks","html_url":"https://github.com/redcodeworks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redcodeworks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redcodeworks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redcodeworks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redcodeworks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redcodeworks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redcodeworks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redcodeworks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redcodeworks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redcodeworks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Why: `exists()` ran `dnf5 repoquery` inside the `while read` loops of install.sh, so dnf5 read the rest of the list from stdin and the loop ended silently at the first `a|b` line. Everything after it was never installed (dx required: 101 of 112).\n\nWhat: `resolve` and `copr` read the list into an array (`mapfile`) before looping, so no command can reach it. New count checks: entries read = entries in the file, installed + excluded + missing = entries read, else the build fails. Test in tests/package-lists.sh with a stub dnf5 that reads stdin (fails on the old installer, passes now). CLAUDE.md contract updated.\n\nVerified: just check, just test (local). Not verified: a run against real dnf5 (CI is the first full run).\n\nEffect: after promotion all three images (octarine-bins, -dx, -gx) get a new latest; consumers must bump their pins.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-17T03:11:01Z","updated_at":"2026-11-17T03:12:06Z","closed_at":"2026-11-17T03:12:04Z","merged_at":"2026-11-17T03:12:04Z","merge_commit_sha":"5cf8fd9c2537d291105b82b78e3b97959a414f12","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"redcodeworks:fix/installer-stdin","ref":"fix/installer-stdin","repo":{"id":1460405409,"node_id":"R_kgDOVwwEoQ","name":"octarine-bins","full_name":"redcodeworks/octarine-bins","owner":{"login":"redcodeworks","id":53149657,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTQ5NjU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53149657?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/redcodeworks","html_url":"https://github.com/redcodeworks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redcodeworks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redcodeworks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redcodeworks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/re